Thumbs.db

# Local feedback database — deliberately excluded so a fresh clone (or a
# fresh Streamlit Cloud deploy) always starts with an empty Trust Ledger,
# never carries over someone's local test clicks. feedback_store.py
# recreates this automatically on first run (self-healing init_db()).
db/*.db

# NOTE: outputs/ (generated dataset) and models/ (trained .pkl files) are
# INTENTIONALLY NOT excluded here. Streamlit Cloud clones this repo fresh
# with no pipeline step to regenerate them — they need to be committed so
# the deployed app has data to load. Generation is fully seeded (seed=42),
# so what's committed is reproducible from data/generate_data.py + src/train_model.py
# at any time if you need to regenerate.
